ound","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A creation of the Sanguine Court's Originium Arts. It is said that just a few drops of fresh blood can spawn an entire swarm of these mindless worms. Once they've latched on, they will never let go until their hunger and thirst have been sated.","abilities":["Deals Arts damage and gains increased ATK depending on the number of units the target is blocking.","Attacks restore HP proportional to damage dealt","Leaves behind <Blood Amber> when defeated."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":4000,"atk":100,"def":200,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"sarkaz_boneguard_fluxcaster_captain":{"slug":"sarkaz_boneguard_fluxcaster_captain","name":"Sarkaz Boneguard Fluxcaster Captain","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Boneguard Fluxcaster Captain.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A Sarkaz Caster responsible for guarding the Feranmut's skeleton, their nature warped due to perpetually drifting through spacetime along with it, to the point that their very existence has become tenuous. In times of emergency, they will call upon the Feranmut's power to hide within the turbulent folds of spacetime before reappearing at a more opportune time to deliver a fatal blow.","abilities":["If defeated within range of a Bloodcalling Altar, slips into a turbulence in spacetime and cannot be attacked during this period.","Will revive on the field when affected by an altar's pulse."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":7000,"atk":420,"def":300,"res":60,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"sarkaz_boneguard_captain":{"slug":"sarkaz_boneguard_captain","name":"Sarkaz Boneguard Captain","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Boneguard Captain.webp","rank":"Elite","rac